From: nxrs contributors
Subject: [PATCH] rp23xx: bound TRNG polls and fail closed after source failure

The RNG collector currently spins forever without a valid sample and retries
health failures without a bound.  Return errors after a finite hardware poll
budget or rejection limit, retain the unhealthy state, and wipe a partial read
before disabling the source and unlocking.  Startup uses the same bounded
transaction.  Do not treat this poll budget as an application wall deadline.

diff --git a/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_rng.c b/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_rng.c
--- a/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_rng.c
+++ b/arch/arm/src/rp23xx/rp23xx_rng.c
@@ -1,290 +1,330 @@
